---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="使用指南" titleEn="Guide">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="使用指南">Guide</div><h1 data-site-text="guideTitle" data-zh="从一条更好的回复开始。">Make the next reply yours.</h1><p class="lead" style="white-space:pre-wrap" data-site-text="guide" data-zh="安装插件，连接账户，设置你的风格，然后在 X 回复框中生成草稿。">Install the extension, connect your account, set your voice, and generate drafts in an X reply box.</p><a class="button" data-site-link="chromeStoreUrl" aria-disabled="true"><span data-site-text="guideCta" data-zh="从 Chrome 应用商店安装">Install from Chrome Web Store</span></a></div>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="grid-3"><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">1</span><h3 data-zh="安装并连接账户">Install and connect</h3><p data-zh="从 Chrome 应用商店安装插件，在设置中心登录与你官网相同的账户。">Install from the Chrome Web Store and sign in through Settings with the same account you use on this website.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">2</span><h3 data-zh="设置你的风格">Set your voice</h3><p data-zh="在中文设置中心填写 Voice Profile、兴趣和写作样本。AI 通过已连接的官网账户提供。">Add your Voice Profile, interests, and writing samples. AI is provided through your connected account.</p></div><div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">3</span><h3 data-zh="检查并发送">Review and send</h3><p data-zh="打开 X 帖子的回复框，选择建议、编辑文字，确认合适后由你自己点击发送。">Open a reply on X, choose a suggestion, edit it, then press Send yourself when ready.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
